  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 103.03 Facility operator",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 103.03 “Facility operator” means the person to whom operation of a facility, in whole or in part, has been contracted or otherwise delegated by the permittee through written agreement. The term does not include certified operator as defined in Env-Sw 102.33.\n\nSource. #14103, effective 10-23-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw100.html"
